# Docs

- Follow Purpose → Status → Non-goals → Contract → Worked example → Open questions.
- Product docs copy from `docs/templates/`. Do not invent passing acceptance output.
- Same change: update ARCHITECTURE / DATA-MODEL / JUDGING / journal when the matching surface moved.
- AI text needs `Reviewed: <name> <date>` before it is treated as true.
- Load `.skills/docs-sync/SKILL.md` after mergeable doc or schema edits.
